+# Open ports on this device's WAN-facing interface.
+#
+# One rule per line:
+#   <proto>  <port>   [# comment]
+#
+# Examples:
+#   tcp  4242   # rnsd TCPServerInterface for external Reticulum peers
+#   udp  4242   # rnsd UDPInterface
+#
+# SSH (tcp/22) is allowed unconditionally and does NOT need an entry here.
+# Managed by the rnsbox-portal UI (Network → Open ports).
